  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A Conductor (shown in the figure) carrying constant current <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> is kept in the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> - <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> plane in a uniform magnetic field <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> . If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> is the magnitude of the total magnetic force acting on the conductor, then the correct statement(s) is (are)<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image15-eab3ad90-5e68-4942-a452-b87a3445a3ba.png\"/></p>",
    "image": null
